    "recommendations": "Ensuring the single access point remains unobstructed and clearly marked from the street frontage could significantly improve response times and navigation for arriving units. Given the long driveway and limited rear access, identifying a designated staging area near the main building could support operations and reduce congestion along the unpaved circulation route. Addressing any vegetation encroachment along the access road and driveway corridor could improve visibility and passability for larger response vehicles. Providing clearly visible address identification at the primary entry point would assist personnel in confirming the correct access route under time-sensitive conditions."
